---
import LocationLayout from '../layouts/LocationLayout.astro';
import { locationsBySlug } from '../data/locations';

const location = locationsBySlug['kent-county'];
---

<LocationLayout 
  location={location}
  title="Personal Injury Lawyer in Kent County | Alex Poberesky Law"
  description="Experienced personal injury and criminal defense attorney serving Kent County, Maryland. Free consultation. Call (410) 484-0400."
>
  <h2>Dedicated Legal Representation in Kent County, Maryland</h2>
  
  <p>
    Kent County, one of Maryland's oldest and smallest counties, offers a peaceful Eastern Shore 
    lifestyle centered around Chestertown and the Chester River. Despite its rural character, 
    residents face the same legal challenges as anywhere else. Attorney Alex Poberesky provides 
    experienced personal injury and criminal defense representation to Kent County clients.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Kent County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Kent County's rural roads and waterways present unique dangers. Whether you've been injured 
    in a collision on Route 213, hurt in a farming accident, or suffered injuries in a boating 
    incident on the Chester River or Chesapeake Bay, you deserve experienced legal representation.
  </p>
  
  <p>We handle all types of personal injury cases in Kent County, including:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car accidents on Routes 213, 291, and local roads</li>
    <li>Agricultural and farm equipment accidents</li>
    <li>Boating and watercraft accidents</li>
    <li>Truck accidents</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice at UM Shore Medical Center at Chestertown</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents</li>
    <li>Premises liability claims</li>
    <li>Wrongful death cases</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Kent County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Facing criminal charges in Kent County can be frightening, especially in a small community 
    where everyone knows each other. We provide discreet, aggressive defense for clients facing 
    DUI charges, drug offenses, assault, theft, and other criminal matters.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Bringing Baltimore Experience to the Eastern Shore</h3>
  
  <p>
    With over 26 years of legal experience, Attorney Poberesky brings seasoned representation 
    to Kent County residents. We travel to Chestertown and surrounding areas to meet with 
    clients and appear in court, ensuring that Eastern Shore residents have access to quality 
    legal representation.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Kent County Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Kent County, including Chestertown, Rock Hall, Galena, 
    Millington, Betterton, Still Pond, and surrounding areas. Contact us today for a free 
    consultation about your case.
  </p>
</LocationLayout>
